        "title": "Beaten back",
        "description": "It came to blows and the player lost: knocked senseless, or ran for it back across the sand. The Crakes take the toll from their pockets and the gate after all.",
        "closing": "Close on the player coming round on the sand, a shilling lighter, and Kell sitting beside them with a split lip saying they'll be seeing those two again.",
